            "user_id": "user_0",
            "username": "admin",
            "display_name": "Admin",
            "avatar_url": ""
          },
          "content": "Great question! To create a thread, navigate to the Circles section, select a circle that matches your topic, and look for the 'New Thread' button. You can also browse existing threads to see how others structure their discussions.",
